# Sub-tick corpus for the terrain UV-scroll path (terrain-tanim): the rows
# check_feeder_subtick.sh --path terrain-tanim replays. Same row form as
# terrain-subtick-corpus.manifest: bk2 | VBL | optional cell rect.
#
# moving-terrain: the Artisans water surface at V=2262, where the one
# UV-scroll descriptor (tile 23) paints on screen and the legs separate
# by 6070 px at alpha 0. The vertex-animation manifest's second row,
# V=2438, is absent: the poly-animated surface is in frame but tile 23
# paints no pixel there, so both legs render the same present at every
# alpha and the floor reports VACUOUS rather than a snap.
moving-terrain.bk2 | 2262 |
